  ('hisui', 142, 10026, false, '고대 문자를 닮은 모습의 포켓몬이다. 먼저 생겨난 것은 문자인가 안농인가. 연구 중이지만 아직도 수수께끼다.', 'It is hard to believe these strangely shaped Pokémon are truly living creatures. I''ve pointed out that the species'' many forms resemble writing from other lands; no one will take me seriously.'),
  ('hisui', 142, 10027, false, '고대 문자를 닮은 모습의 포켓몬이다. 먼저 생겨난 것은 문자인가 안농인가. 연구 중이지만 아직도 수수께끼다.', 'It is hard to believe these strangely shaped Pokémon are truly living creatures. I''ve pointed out that the species'' many forms resemble writing from other lands; no one will take me seriously.'),
  ('hisui', 143, 363, true, '파도에 떠다니며 바다의 상태를 살핀다. 먹이를 발견하면 무리의 씨카이저에게 알린다.', 'During the season when drift ice approaches the shore, Spheal prefers living on the ice—where fewer predators lurk—rather than the land. Its fur retains heat superbly and resists harsh cold.'),
  ('hisui', 144, 364, true, '대굴레오나 몬스터볼 등 둥근 것이라면 뭐든지 코 위에 올려놓고 돌리는 습성이 있다.', 'Its white whiskers are very sensitive. Sealeo will balance Spheal on the tip of its nose, checking its scent and its feel to be sure the Spheal is healthy.'),
  ('hisui', 145, 365, true, '이빨은 평생 자란다. 싸우다 부러져도 1년이 지나면 원래의 훌륭한 이빨로 복원된다.', 'Its thick tusks are strong enough to shatter drift ice. They have been known to break, but they will grow back by the next year. The Hisui region is well known for these broken tusks.'),
  ('hisui', 146, 223, true, '빨판처럼 변화한 등지느러미로 만타인에게 달라붙어 먹다 남은 것을 얻어먹고 있다.', 'Spits water from its mouth with incredible accuracy. It captures Burmy by shooting them down off the branches from which they dangle.'),
  ('hisui', 147, 224, true, '머리가 돌처럼 단단하다. 빨판이 붙어 있는 다리를 휘감아 끊임없이 머리로 세게 때린다.', 'While Octillery still shoots water from its mouth, the drastic anatomical difference between it and Remoraid meant that for a long time, no one believed the former evolved from the latter.'),
  ('hisui', 148, 451, true, '독이 있는 꼬리의 발톱으로 덤벼든다. 집히면 독이 스며들어 움직일 수 없게 된다.', 'Its claws are not only razor-sharp but poisonous, making Skorupi a highly dangerous Pokémon. It seems to be weakened by cold temperatures, however.'),
  ('hisui', 149, 452, true, '사막의 악마라고 불릴 정도로 사납지만 하마돈에게는 싸움도 걸지 않고 얌전하다.', 'Has a brutish, ferocious temperament. With immense strength and a sturdy shell off which swords will bounce, it rampages about and wreaks havoc.'),
  ('hisui', 150, 58, true, '충직한 성격으로 자신의 트레이너를 지키기 위해 필사적으로 상대방에게 짖어댄다.', 'They patrol their territory in pairs. I believe the igneous rock components in the fur of this species are the result of volcanic activity in its habitat.'),
  ('hisui', 150, 10398, false, '충직한 성격으로 자신의 트레이너를 지키기 위해 필사적으로 상대방에게 짖어댄다.', 'They patrol their territory in pairs. I believe the igneous rock components in the fur of this species are the result of volcanic activity in its habitat.'),
  ('hisui', 151, 59, true, '옛날부터 많은 사람의 마음을 사로잡은 아름다운 포켓몬이다. 마치 나는 것처럼 경쾌하게 달린다.', 'Snaps at its foes with fangs cloaked in blazing flame. Despite its bulk, it deftly feints every which way, leading opponents on a deceptively merry chase as it all but dances around them.'),
  ('hisui', 151, 10399, false, '옛날부터 많은 사람의 마음을 사로잡은 아름다운 포켓몬이다. 마치 나는 것처럼 경쾌하게 달린다.', 'Snaps at its foes with fangs cloaked in blazing flame. Despite its bulk, it deftly feints every which way, leading opponents on a deceptively merry chase as it all but dances around them.'),
  ('hisui', 152, 431, true, '기분이 좋은 나옹마는 꼬리로 리듬 체조의 리본처럼 아름다운 움직임을 보인다.', 'Bewitches humans with its helical tail and piercing gaze. Its hidden claws are quite sharp as well, making this Pokémon an exceedingly tricky opponent if antagonized.'),
  ('hisui', 153, 432, true, '몸을 크게 보여서 상대를 위압하기 위해 두 갈래의 꼬리로 허리를 꼭 쥐고 있다.', 'Though impudent and difficult to tame, Purugly enjoys great popularity due to its fur, the beauty of which surpasses even velveteen.'),
  ('hisui', 154, 66, true, '언제나 파워풀하다. 체력이 남아돌기 때문에 심심풀이로 바위를 들어 올리며 더 강해진다.', 'Though as small as a child, it has strength enough to easily throw a well-built adult. Striving to become ever stronger, Machop trains by carrying a Graveler on its shoulders.'),
  ('hisui', 155, 67, true, '지치지 않는 강인한 육체를 가졌다. 무거운 물건을 옮기는 등의 일을 돕는다.', 'A sturdy creature boasting a robust physique and boundless stamina. Loves training above all else and voluntarily assists with tasks such as construction and clearing land.'),
  ('hisui', 156, 68, true, '4개의 팔은 생각하는 것보다 빠르게 반사적으로 움직이며 여러 발의 펀치를 날린다.', 'In close combat, its four arms afford it offensive and defensive supremacy. In but a blink, this valiant Pokémon can overwhelm its foes with more than 1,000 blows from its fists.'),
  ('hisui', 156, 10370, false, '4개의 팔은 생각하는 것보다 빠르게 반사적으로 움직이며 여러 발의 펀치를 날린다.', 'In close combat, its four arms afford it offensive and defensive supremacy. In but a blink, this valiant Pokémon can overwhelm its foes with more than 1,000 blows from its fists.'),
  ('hisui', 157, 441, true, '사람의 말을 기억해서 운다. 동료가 한 장소에 모이면 모두 똑같은 말을 기억한다.', 'A versatile performer skilled in the imitation of human speech. It is said that older, more experienced Chatot can even understand the meaning of the words they mimic.'),
  ('hisui', 158, 355, true, '모습을 투명하게 하고 몰래 먹잇감에 다가간다. 두꺼운 벽을 통과하는 능력을 지녔다.', 'I''ve heard that the children of Hisui all begin to behave once they''ve been told the story of how this Pokémon roams about before the witching hour to spirit away misbehaving children.'),
  ('hisui', 159, 356, true, '떠도는 사람의 영혼을 찾아 텅 빈 체내로 빨아들인다. 그 후 영혼이 어떻게 되는지는 알 수 없다.', 'There are rumors that peeking inside its bandage-wrapped body will cause one to get pulled in through the gaps between the bandages, never to return. I''ve been too scared to verify.'),
  ('hisui', 160, 477, true, '노린 상대를 배의 입으로 통째로 삼킨다. 영혼만 먹은 뒤 육체는 뱉어내고 떠난다.', 'Comes to those whose lives have come to an end and escorts their souls to the afterlife. Known to mistakenly take the souls of those who yet have life left in them, albeit rarely.'),
  ('hisui', 161, 393, true, '자존심이 강해서 사람에게 먹이를 얻는 것을 싫어한다. 긴 솜털이 추위를 막는다.', 'Prefers cold climes and appears along coasts. It''s an adorable little thing—as cute as any child—but it''s also prideful, unwilling to accept handouts from people.'),
  ('hisui', 162, 394, true, '무리를 만들지 않고 생활한다. 날개의 강렬한 일격은 큰 나무를 두 동강으로 꺾는다.', 'It swims gracefully through the frigid sea and sings with a voice like the roaring tide. It has powerful, sturdy wings and dignity to match.'),
  ('hisui', 163, 395, true, '부리에서 늘어난 3개의 뿔은 강하다는 것을 증명한다. 리더의 뿔이 제일 크다.', 'Since ancient times, it has been revered by the people of Hisui, who call it the Master of the Waves. Its wings are a match for even master-crafted blades.'),
  ('hisui', 164, 458, true, '총어 무리에 섞여서 헤엄친다. 적에게 습격당하면 무리와 함께 싸운다.', 'Though ball-like in shape, this Pokémon is a proficient swimmer. I have discovered that if a Mantyke spends much time with schools of Remoraid, it will eventually achieve evolution.'),
  ('hisui', 165, 226, true, '여유롭게 바다를 헤엄친다. 먹다 남은 음식을 노린 총어가 달라붙어 있어도 신경 쓰지 않는다.', 'This calm and gentle Pokémon swims gracefully through the sea. After building speed, it can leap out of the water. It is often misidentified as a bird Pokémon due to this behavior.'),
  ('hisui', 166, 550, true, '옛날에는 식탁에 올랐다. 적색근 배쓰나이의 살코기는 기름이 많아 젊은 층이 좋아한다.', 'Though it differs from other Basculin in several respects, including demeanor—this one is gentle—I have categorized it as a regional form given the vast array of shared qualities.'),
  ('hisui', 166, 10066, false, '옛날에는 식탁에 올랐다. 적색근 배쓰나이의 살코기는 기름이 많아 젊은 층이 좋아한다.', 'Though it differs from other Basculin in several respects, including demeanor—this one is gentle—I have categorized it as a regional form given the vast array of shared qualities.'),
  ('hisui', 166, 10416, false, '옛날에는 식탁에 올랐다. 적색근 배쓰나이의 살코기는 기름이 많아 젊은 층이 좋아한다.', 'Though it differs from other Basculin in several respects, including demeanor—this one is gentle—I have categorized it as a regional form given the vast array of shared qualities.'),
  ('hisui', 167, 902, true, null, 'Clads itself in the souls of comrades that perished before fulfilling their goals of journeying upstream. No other species throughout all Hisui''s rivers is Basculegion''s equal.'),
  ('hisui', 167, 10417, false, null, 'Clads itself in the souls of comrades that perished before fulfilling their goals of journeying upstream. No other species throughout all Hisui''s rivers is Basculegion''s equal.'),
  ('hisui', 168, 37, true, '6개의 꼬리는 자라면서 털의 결이 좋아지며 아름다워진다. 안으면 살짝 따듯하다.', 'In its belly burns a fire, which Vulpix spits out in the form of fireballs. When young, this Pokémon has but one white tail. As the Pokémon matures, this single tail splits into six.'),
  ('hisui', 168, 10205, false, '6개의 꼬리는 자라면서 털의 결이 좋아지며 아름다워진다. 안으면 살짝 따듯하다.', 'In its belly burns a fire, which Vulpix spits out in the form of fireballs. When young, this Pokémon has but one white tail. As the Pokémon matures, this single tail splits into six.'),
  ('hisui', 169, 38, true, '머리가 좋고 집념이 강하다. 장난으로 꼬리를 잡으면 1000년 동안 화를 입는다고 한다.', 'The coat of gleaming golden fur is quite magnificent. This species is said to store sacred power in its nine long tails and to live for a millennium.'),
  ('hisui', 169, 10206, false, '머리가 좋고 집념이 강하다. 장난으로 꼬리를 잡으면 1000년 동안 화를 입는다고 한다.', 'The coat of gleaming golden fur is quite magnificent. This species is said to store sacred power in its nine long tails and to live for a millennium.'),
  ('hisui', 170, 72, true, '몸의 대부분이 수분이어서 바닷속에서는 물과 동화되어 매우 구분하기 힘들다.', 'They fire beams from the glassy, magenta orbs that resemble eyes atop their heads, and they drift in shallow seas. During low tide, they can sometimes be found on beaches, desiccated.'),
  ('hisui', 171, 73, true, '80개의 촉수는 자유롭게 늘어났다가 줄어든다. 그물처럼 펼쳐서 먹이를 잡고 독바늘로 찌른다.', 'It has 80 tentacles, each with a venomous tip. These tentacles are also extendible, lengthening when Tentacruel attempts to catch prey. Use caution.'),
  ('hisui', 172, 456, true, '빛나는 꼬리지느러미로 먹이를 유인한다. 낮에는 해수면 가까이 있다가 밤이 되면 깊은 곳으로 이동한다.', 'What a gorgeous sight this Pokémon is as it swims with its long, pink-painted caudal fins fluttering behind it. Finneon''s beautiful appearance has led to its nickname: ”finery fish.”'),
  ('hisui', 173, 457, true, '심해 해저를 기어가듯 헤엄친다. 환상적인 지느러미의 빛은 밤하늘의 별과 같다.', 'Uses its gleaming fins to hunt its prey. The view of Lumineon schooling near the surface of the sea at night is breathtaking— it''s as though there were shining stars right there.'),
  ('hisui', 174, 240, true, '화산 주위에 살고 있다. 하루를 마칠 때에는 마그마에 잠겨 피로를 푼다.', 'This Pokémon lives in volcanic areas. With each breath, sparks spurt from its mouth and nose. When Magby is in good health, its flames gain a yellow tint.'),
  ('hisui', 175, 126, true, '온몸이 늘 불타고 있다. 화재를 일으키는 원인 중 하나로 두려움의 대상이 되고 있다.', 'Legend has it that this Pokémon was born from the crater of a volcano. When wounded, it bathes in lava to heal its body, much as one would soak in a hot spring.'),
  ('hisui', 176, 467, true, '화산의 화구에서 사는 동안 마그마 덩어리 모양의 기관을 가진 화산 같은 몸이 되었다.', 'Use of a strange item caused this Pokémon to evolve. Fireballs launched from the ends of its tubelike arms are hot enough to melt an iron pot in an instant.'),
  ('hisui', 177, 81, true, '전기를 먹으며 살아간다. 좌우의 유닛에서 전기자석파를 방사하며 하늘을 난다.', 'A bizarre Pokémon with but a single eye embedded in an iron sphere. I suspect this creature levitates due to the magnetism it emits from its arms, which resemble horseshoe-shaped magnets.'),
  ('hisui', 178, 82, true, '강한 자력을 끊임없이 발산한다. 레어코일이 접근하면 대부분의 컴퓨터에 이상 현상이 발생한다.', 'Three Magnemite gathered to evolve into this Pokémon. The source of much vexation on my part, as its powerful magnetism destroys my research equipment.'),
  ('hisui', 179, 462, true, '특수한 자기장의 영향으로 몸의 분자 구조가 변화해 진화했다고 여겨지고 있다.', 'I theorize that a special magnetic field influenced this Pokémon, changing its molecular structure and causing it to evolve. It emits strange radio waves toward space from its antenna.'),
  ('hisui', 180, 436, true, '닦으면 빛이 나며 진실을 비춘다고 전해지지만 동미러는 닦이는 걸 매우 싫어한다.', 'Floats using a mysterious energy. The pattern engraved upon its back is held as sacred and can sometimes be found in imagery from ancient cemeteries and other such timeworn places.'),
  ('hisui', 181, 437, true, '몸의 무늬 때문에 본래 가라르에는 없던 포켓몬이라고 생각하는 학자도 많다.', 'Some believe that its bell-like cry opens holes to another world. It has been revered as a deity since ancient times.'),
  ('hisui', 182, 239, true, '아직 전기를 모으는 게 서툴다. 전기를 먹기 위해 민가에 숨어들어 콘센트를 찾는다.', 'They generate electricity by spinning their arms. During a thunderstorm, if one hears the lively voices of children out in the wilderness, what one is actually hearing are the voices of Elekid.'),
  ('hisui', 183, 125, true, '폭풍이 치면 높은 나무 주위에 모여 번개가 떨어지기를 가만히 기다린다.', 'Feeds on electrical energy. During sudden showers beneath looming thunderclouds, one can observe Electabuzz scaling tall trees, where the Pokémon will then wait for lightning to strike.'),
  ('hisui', 184, 466, true, '발전량은 전기포켓몬 중에서도 손꼽히는 수준이다. 꼬리 끝에서 고압 전류를 방전한다.', 'Its evolution was induced by an unusual item, and its electrical output rises along with its heart rate. From its tails, it can unleash an electric current measuring 20,000 volts.'),
  ('hisui', 185, 207, true, '소리 내지 않고 미끄러지듯 활공한다. 양손의 커다란 손톱과 발의 발톱으로 먹이의 얼굴에 달라붙어 독침을 찌른다.', 'Its tail is tipped by a thick, horrible stinger. To bring down prey, it will first obscure their vision by covering their faces with its body, and then it will use the stinger to inject them with venom.'),
  ('hisui', 186, 472, true, '날갯소리를 내지 않고 하늘을 난다. 긴 꼬리로 먹이를 잡아 송곳니로 급소를 공격한다.', 'It glides soundlessly on pitch-black wings and sinks sharp fangs into the throat of its prey. It takes on a look of satisfaction once it has entirely drained its prey of blood.'),
  ('hisui', 187, 443, true, '움직이는 것은 무조건 공격해서 보금자리 굴로 데려간다. 입은 크지만 위는 작은 편이다.', 'It nests in caves untouched by sunlight. Its sharp teeth may fall out when worn away or after an impact, but they regrow within a few days.'),
  ('hisui', 188, 444, true, '거처인 동굴에 보석을 매장하는데 그곳에 침입자가 들어가면 즉시 발톱과 이빨로 갈기갈기 찢어버린다.', 'Though Gabite are usually of a violent disposition, when I gave one a glass bead it had been eyeing covetously, it suddenly became quite docile.'),
  ('hisui', 189, 445, true, '지상에서도 움직임이 빠르다. 설산에서는 체온이 떨어지기 전에 먹이를 잡아 거처로 돌아간다.', 'Soars across the heavens at blinding speed—a magnificent sight! It has a feral disposition. Utmost caution is required if one meets a Garchomp out in the wilds.'),
  ('hisui', 189, 10158, false, '지상에서도 움직임이 빠르다. 설산에서는 체온이 떨어지기 전에 먹이를 잡아 거처로 돌아간다.', 'Soars across the heavens at blinding speed—a magnificent sight! It has a feral disposition. Utmost caution is required if one meets a Garchomp out in the wilds.'),
  ('hisui', 190, 299, true, '강력한 자력으로 먹이를 끌어당겨 움직이지 않고 사냥을 하지만 천적을 끌어당기는 일도 있다.', 'Once the people of Hisui discovered that its red nose always points north, they grew to rely on it greatly when traveling afar. The nose seems to work in a similar way to ancient compasses.'),
  ('hisui', 191, 476, true, '3개의 작은 유닛을 사용해서 먹이를 잡거나 적과 싸운다. 본체는 거의 명령할 뿐이다.', 'It is able to emit powerful magnetism, allowing it control over the iron sand that forms its luscious mustache. Using this iron sand, Probopass forms hard stones with which it smites its prey.'),
  ('hisui', 192, 100, true, '몬스터볼과 닮은 것은 보호색으로 위장하기 위해서라고 전해지나 의외로 쉽게 자폭한다.', 'An enigmatic Pokémon that happens to bear a resemblance to a Poké Ball. When excited, it discharges the electric current it has stored in its belly, then lets out a great, uproarious laugh.'),
  ('hisui', 192, 10400, false, '몬스터볼과 닮은 것은 보호색으로 위장하기 위해서라고 전해지나 의외로 쉽게 자폭한다.', 'An enigmatic Pokémon that happens to bear a resemblance to a Poké Ball. When excited, it discharges the electric current it has stored in its belly, then lets out a great, uproarious laugh.'),
  ('hisui', 193, 101, true, '조금이라도 충격을 주면 체내에 있는 전기 에너지가 넘쳐서 폭발해버린다.', 'The tissue on the surface of its body is curiously similar in composition to an Apricorn. When irritated, this Pokémon lets loose an electric current equal to 20 lightning bolts.'),
  ('hisui', 193, 10401, false, '조금이라도 충격을 주면 체내에 있는 전기 에너지가 넘쳐서 폭발해버린다.', 'The tissue on the surface of its body is curiously similar in composition to an Apricorn. When irritated, this Pokémon lets loose an electric current equal to 20 lightning bolts.'),
  ('hisui', 194, 479, true, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('hisui', 194, 10058, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('hisui', 194, 10059, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('hisui', 194, 10060, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('hisui', 194, 10061, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('hisui', 194, 10062, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('hisui', 195, 433, true, '뛰어오르면 입안에 있는 구슬이 사방에 반사되어 방울 같은 음색을 만들어 낸다.', 'This Pokémon gave me an excruciating headache when it seemingly cried out without making a sound. Perhaps there are some sounds that the human ear is simply incapable of hearing.'),
  ('hisui', 196, 358, true, '바람이 강해지면 나뭇가지나 처마 끝에 머리의 흡반으로 매달려 울기 시작한다. 긴 꼬리로 나무열매를 집어서 먹는다.', 'Can emit waves of air powerful enough to knock out prey taller than itself. I hypothesize that it amplifies the faint sound of wind within its body.'),
  ('hisui', 197, 200, true, '사람이 울부짖는 소리를 흉내 내 모두를 겁주고 기뻐한다. 담력이 강한 상대는 좋아하지 않는다.', 'It conceals itself in darkness, sending chills up travelers'' spines with its childlike weeping. As it observes the frightened travelers with glee, the red orbs upon its chest let off an eerie light.'),
  ('hisui', 198, 429, true, '저주의 말을 중얼거리며 심한 두통이나 무서운 환상을 보여 줘서 괴롭힌다.', 'The incantations Mismagius chants can ward against misfortune, so a custom exists of inviting it into one''s home. Incur the Pokémon''s displeasure, however, and disaster will surely ensue.'),
  ('hisui', 199, 173, true, '실루엣이 별 모양이다. 그 때문에 별똥별을 타고 온다고 여겨진다.', 'In silhouette, they resemble twinkling starlight. When shooting stars rain from the night sky, Cleffa gather in numbers and dance as though they are indeed incarnations of the stars.'),
  ('hisui', 200, 35, true, '애교 있는 몸동작과 울음소리로 귀엽다고 많은 인기를 누리는 포켓몬. 그러나 좀처럼 눈에 띄지 않는다.', 'It can be found in quiet mountain areas on a full moon''s night. Its dancing and its tiny, faintly glowing wings confer upon it a lovely fairylike quality.'),
  ('hisui', 201, 36, true, '1km 앞에 떨어진 바늘 소리가 들릴 정도로 귀가 좋아 평소에는 조용한 곳에서 지낸다.', 'Legend says that on clear, quiet nights, it listens for the voices of its kin living on the moon. I, too, often think of my homeland, so far away.'),
  ('hisui', 202, 215, true, '교활하고 사나운 성질을 가졌다. 부모가 없는 틈에 둥지로 침입해서 알을 훔친다.', 'Its sturdy, curved claws are ideal for traversing precipitous cliffs. From the tips of these claws drips a venom that infiltrates the nerves of any prey caught in Sneasel''s grasp.'),
  ('hisui', 202, 10404, false, '교활하고 사나운 성질을 가졌다. 부모가 없는 틈에 둥지로 침입해서 알을 훔친다.', 'Its sturdy, curved claws are ideal for traversing precipitous cliffs. From the tips of these claws drips a venom that infiltrates the nerves of any prey caught in Sneasel''s grasp.'),
  ('hisui', 203, 903, true, null, 'Because of Sneasler''s virulent poison and daunting physical prowess, no other species could hope to best it on the frozen highlands. Preferring solitude, this species does not form packs.'),
  ('hisui', 204, 461, true, '발톱으로 사인을 그려 동료와 연락한다. 사인의 종류는 500가지가 넘는다고 한다.', 'This species corners prey as a pack, under the guidance of a leader. Weavile displays increased cunning, leading me to speculate that its evolution caused further brain development.'),
  ('hisui', 205, 361, true, '추운 땅에서만 살 수 있다. 영하 100도의 환경에서도 건강하게 뛰어다닌다.', 'Arrives alongside the first snow. It''s thought that homes Snorunt visit will prosper for many generations. By tradition, one might offer a lump of ice made from pure water at one''s front door.'),
  ('hisui', 206, 362, true, '공기 중의 수분을 단숨에 얼게 하는 힘으로 먹이를 냉동시켜 버린다.', 'It covers its body with an armor of ice harder than steel. Uses its breath to freeze prey, which it then devours as if they were frozen desserts.'),
  ('hisui', 206, 10176, false, '공기 중의 수분을 단숨에 얼게 하는 힘으로 먹이를 냉동시켜 버린다.', 'It covers its body with an armor of ice harder than steel. Uses its breath to freeze prey, which it then devours as if they were frozen desserts.'),
  ('hisui', 207, 478, true, '마이너스 50도의 냉기를 뿜어 먹이를 얼린 뒤 거처로 가져가서 가지런히 나열한다.', 'A Pokémon inhabited by the soul of a woman who died bearing a grudge in the snowy mountains. Legends of Froslass placing deathly curses on misbehaving men send shivers down my spine.'),
  ('hisui', 208, 408, true, '단단한 두개골이 특징이다. 박치기로 나무를 부러뜨려 잘 익은 나무열매를 먹었다.', 'An incredibly rare sight. They duel each other by ramming their heads together, and the resulting sound echoes throughout the area like the pealing of a bell.'),
  ('hisui', 209, 409, true, '박치기가 특기인 고대 포켓몬이다. 뇌가 정말 작기 때문에 멍청해서 멸종했다는 설도 있다.', 'Very little is known about its biology. Can knock down massive trees by smashing its beautiful, pearl-like crown against them.'),
  ('hisui', 210, 410, true, '태고의 지층에서 화석이 발견되었지만 얼굴 이외의 부분이 발견된 적은 없다.', 'Much remains unknown about this Pokémon, as few have ever seen it. However, we know that it is calm and dislikes conflict, and it enjoys polishing its face against trees and rocks.'),
  ('hisui', 211, 411, true, '약 1억 년 전의 포켓몬이다. 무섭게 튼튼한 얼굴은 강철 이상의 경도를 가졌다.', 'Its face is sturdy—as strong as diamond—and this hardness offers a very stable defense. Much about this species is still unknown, such as its natural habitat.'),
  ('hisui', 212, 220, true, '좋은 냄새를 맡으면 뒷일을 생각하지 않고 냄새 나는 방향으로 대시해버린다.', 'Swinub excels at sniffing out mushrooms buried beneath grass or snow. Since ancient times, the people of Hisui have often relied upon this skill.'),
  ('hisui', 213, 221, true, '4개의 다리는 짧지만 발굽이 넓고 거칠거칠하므로 눈 위도 미끄러지지 않고 걸을 수 있다.', 'The long fur of this Pokémon covers its eyes, ears, and even limbs, allowing Piloswine to resist harshly frigid conditions. The Pokémon''s white tusks can be used to defeat its enemies.'),
  ('hisui', 214, 473, true, '생긴 것처럼 힘이 장사다. 얼음으로 된 엄니는 추울수록 굵고 길어지면서 늠름해진다.', 'This species reached its zenith during the period known as the ice age. I suspect that Hisui''s frigid climate is in harmony with Mamoswine''s constitution, thus awakening hidden potential.'),
  ('hisui', 215, 712, true, '혹한의 지역에 서식한다. 크레베이스의 등에 자신의 발을 얼어붙게 해 고정한다.', 'Lives on mountains blanketed in perennial snow. It freezes water vapor in the air to make the ice helmet that it dons for defense.'),
  ('hisui', 216, 713, true, '낮 동안의 활동으로 몸의 균열이 깊어지지만 하룻밤 사이에 균열이 없는 몸으로 돌아간다.', 'The armor of ice covering its lower jaw puts steel to shame and can shatter rocks with ease. This Pokémon barrels along steep mountain paths, cleaving through the deep snow.'),
  ('hisui', 216, 10412, false, '낮 동안의 활동으로 몸의 균열이 깊어지지만 하룻밤 사이에 균열이 없는 몸으로 돌아간다.', 'The armor of ice covering its lower jaw puts steel to shame and can shatter rocks with ease. This Pokémon barrels along steep mountain paths, cleaving through the deep snow.'),
  ('hisui', 217, 459, true, '배에 열리는 아이스크림 같은 나무열매는 가라르에 사는 달막화들이 매우 좋아한다.', 'One is likely to encounter this Pokémon while out in the snow. There are stories of Snover appearing in human settlements but doing no harm—rather, they bond with the children.'),
  ('hisui', 218, 460, true, '블리자드를 일으키는 포켓몬이다. 커다란 몸을 흔들면 부근 일대는 금세 새하얗게 된다.', 'A powerful Pokémon that can split huge boulders with ease. Dislikes associating with others and chooses to live quietly deep within the mountains, playing with the snow.'),
  ('hisui', 218, 10160, false, '블리자드를 일으키는 포켓몬이다. 커다란 몸을 흔들면 부근 일대는 금세 새하얗게 된다.', 'A powerful Pokémon that can split huge boulders with ease. Dislikes associating with others and chooses to live quietly deep within the mountains, playing with the snow.'),
  ('hisui', 219, 570, true, '먹이를 찾아 사람으로 둔갑하여 마을에 나타나기도 한다. 주로 아이로 둔갑한다.', 'A once-departed soul, returned to life in Hisui. Derives power from resentment, which rises as energy atop its head and takes on the forms of foes. In this way, Zorua vents lingering malice.'),
  ('hisui', 219, 10407, false, '먹이를 찾아 사람으로 둔갑하여 마을에 나타나기도 한다. 주로 아이로 둔갑한다.', 'A once-departed soul, returned to life in Hisui. Derives power from resentment, which rises as energy atop its head and takes on the forms of foes. In this way, Zorua vents lingering malice.'),
  ('hisui', 220, 571, true, '고독한 트레이너는 조로아크에게 환상을 보여주도록 명령하여 혼자만의 외로움을 달랜다.', 'With its disheveled white fur, it looks like an embodiment of death. Heedless of its own safety, Zoroark attacks its nemeses with a bitter energy so intense, it lacerates Zoroark''s own body.'),
  ('hisui', 220, 10408, false, '고독한 트레이너는 조로아크에게 환상을 보여주도록 명령하여 혼자만의 외로움을 달랜다.', 'With its disheveled white fur, it looks like an embodiment of death. Heedless of its own safety, Zoroark attacks its nemeses with a bitter energy so intense, it lacerates Zoroark''s own body.'),
  ('hisui', 221, 627, true, '딱딱한 나무열매도 산산조각 내는 악력을 가졌다. 쉽게 다투고 아무에게나 승부를 건다.', 'Its chick-like looks belie its hotheadedness. It challenges its parents at every opportunity, desperate to prove its strength.'),
  ('hisui', 222, 628, true, '혈기왕성하고 거칠어서 가라르의 배달부 자리는 아머까오에게 뺏겼다.', 'Screaming a bloodcurdling battle cry, this huge and ferocious bird Pokémon goes out on the hunt. It blasts lakes with shock waves, then scoops up any prey that float to the water''s surface.'),
  ('hisui', 222, 10409, false, '혈기왕성하고 거칠어서 가라르의 배달부 자리는 아머까오에게 뺏겼다.', 'Screaming a bloodcurdling battle cry, this huge and ferocious bird Pokémon goes out on the hunt. It blasts lakes with shock waves, then scoops up any prey that float to the water''s surface.'),
  ('hisui', 223, 447, true, '상대의 감정뿐만 아니라 자연의 상태도 파동이라는 파장의 형태로 느낀다.', 'Though infantile in appearance, it has the mysterious ability to read the minds of humans. The pure of heart are met with Riolu''s approval, while those of ill nature earn only its loathing.'),
  ('hisui', 224, 448, true, '사람이 생각하는 것도 알 수 있기 때문에 정직한 마음을 가진 트레이너만 따른다.', 'A most gallant-looking creature. It emits energy waves and controls them with precision, using them to sense even faraway beings. I have given the name ”aura” to this power.'),
  ('hisui', 224, 10159, false, '사람이 생각하는 것도 알 수 있기 때문에 정직한 마음을 가진 트레이너만 따른다.', 'A most gallant-looking creature. It emits energy waves and controls them with precision, using them to sense even faraway beings. I have given the name ”aura” to this power.'),
  ('hisui', 225, 480, true, '유크시의 탄생에 의해 사람들의 생활을 풍요롭게 하는 지혜가 생겨났다고 전해진다.', 'A Pokémon feared but also respected for stealing away the memories of evildoers. I have found records that suggest Uxie holds dominion over knowledge.'),
  ('hisui', 226, 481, true, '호수의 밑바닥에서 잠자고 있지만 영혼이 빠져나가서 수면을 날아다닌다고 전해진다.', 'Known as the Being of Emotion. In legend, this Pokémon was feared, as any who showed disrespect would have their emotions thrown into disarray.'),
  ('hisui', 227, 482, true, '유크시, 엠라이트, 아그놈은 같은 알에서 태어난 포켓몬이라 여겨지고 있다.', 'The dreaded Being of Willpower. Legends tell of this Pokémon manipulating the will of its adversaries and turning them into puppets of its own.'),
  ('hisui', 228, 485, true, '마그마처럼 타오르는 혈액이 몸에서 흐르고 있다. 화산의 동굴에 서식한다.', 'Stories tell of this Pokémon being birthed from the boiling magma within Mount Coronet. Its molten-steel body holds many mysteries.'),
  ('hisui', 229, 486, true, '다양한 재료로 포켓몬을 만든 후 대륙을 지금의 장소로 이동시켰다고 전해진다.', 'According to legend, Regigigas pulled landmasses together and bound them with rope to create the continent of Hisui. Though I have my doubts, the story could well contain a shred of truth.'),
  ('hisui', 230, 488, true, '크레세리아의 날개를 가지고 자면 즐거운 꿈을 꿀 수 있다고 한다. 초승달의 화신으로 불리고 있다.', 'Cresselia is reminiscent of the crescent moon. It leaves a brilliant line of light in its wake as it flies across the night sky. I daresay it resembles the heavenly maiden who created the Milky Way.'),
  ('hisui', 231, 641, true, '토네로스의 꼬리에서 뿜어져 나온 에너지가 큰 폭풍을 일으킨다. 민가를 날려버릴 정도의 힘이다.', 'This storm-stirring Pokémon is said to cause the seasons to turn by whipping up the air. I suspect its humanlike form to be a false one.'),
  ('hisui', 231, 10079, false, '토네로스의 꼬리에서 뿜어져 나온 에너지가 큰 폭풍을 일으킨다. 민가를 날려버릴 정도의 힘이다.', 'This storm-stirring Pokémon is said to cause the seasons to turn by whipping up the air. I suspect its humanlike form to be a false one.'),
  ('hisui', 232, 642, true, '넓은 하늘을 날아다니며 여기저기 번개를 떨어뜨려 산불을 내기 때문에 미움받는다.', 'They say this wielder of electricity has waged war with its nemesis, Tornadus, since time immemorial. The lightning bolts it hurls pierce the very earth and enrich the soil.'),
  ('hisui', 232, 10080, false, '넓은 하늘을 날아다니며 여기저기 번개를 떨어뜨려 산불을 내기 때문에 미움받는다.', 'They say this wielder of electricity has waged war with its nemesis, Tornadus, since time immemorial. The lightning bolts it hurls pierce the very earth and enrich the soil.'),
  ('hisui', 233, 645, true, '바람이나 번개를 거둬들여 바꾼 에너지가 흙에 영양을 주어 대지를 풍족하게 한다.', 'When the incarnations of wind and of lightning clash, Landorus arrives to quell the conflict. After the tempests and thunderbolts abate, the land is sure to be blessed with bountiful harvests.'),
  ('hisui', 233, 10081, false, '바람이나 번개를 거둬들여 바꾼 에너지가 흙에 영양을 주어 대지를 풍족하게 한다.', 'When the incarnations of wind and of lightning clash, Landorus arrives to quell the conflict. After the tempests and thunderbolts abate, the land is sure to be blessed with bountiful harvests.'),
  ('hisui', 234, 905, true, null, 'When it flies to this land from across the sea, the bitter winter comes to an end. According to legend, this Pokémon''s love gives rise to the budding of fresh life across Hisui.'),
  ('hisui', 234, 10418, false, null, 'When it flies to this land from across the sea, the bitter winter comes to an end. According to legend, this Pokémon''s love gives rise to the budding of fresh life across Hisui.'),
  ('hisui', 235, 483, true, '시간을 조종하는 힘을 가지고 있다. 신오지방에서는 신이라고 불리며 신화에 등장한다.', 'This Pokémon is revered as a deity in Hisuian legend. The birth of Dialga was what caused the vast river of time to begin flowing in our world.'),
  ('hisui', 235, 10414, false, '시간을 조종하는 힘을 가지고 있다. 신오지방에서는 신이라고 불리며 신화에 등장한다.', 'This Pokémon is revered as a deity in Hisuian legend. The birth of Dialga was what caused the vast river of time to begin flowing in our world.'),
  ('hisui', 236, 484, true, '공간을 뒤틀리게 하는 능력을 가졌으며 신오지방의 신화에서는 신으로 묘사되고 있다.', 'This Pokémon is feared as a deity in Hisuian legend. The birth of Palkia was what caused the walls of our world to disappear, creating a sky that spans for infinity.'),
  ('hisui', 236, 10415, false, '공간을 뒤틀리게 하는 능력을 가졌으며 신오지방의 신화에서는 신으로 묘사되고 있다.', 'This Pokémon is feared as a deity in Hisuian legend. The birth of Palkia was what caused the walls of our world to disappear, creating a sky that spans for infinity.'),
  ('hisui', 237, 487, true, '난폭하다는 이유로 쫓겨났지만 깨어진 세계라고 전해지는 장소에서 조용히 원래 세계를 보고 있었다.', 'There is one Hisuian verse that tells of a powerful light creating a deep shadow. I imagine that this deep shadow is Giratina.'),
  ('hisui', 237, 10063, false, '난폭하다는 이유로 쫓겨났지만 깨어진 세계라고 전해지는 장소에서 조용히 원래 세계를 보고 있었다.', 'There is one Hisuian verse that tells of a powerful light creating a deep shadow. I imagine that this deep shadow is Giratina.'),
  ('hisui', 238, 493, true, '우주가 아직 생기지 않았을 무렵에 처음으로 태어난 포켓몬이라고 신화 속에서 묘사된다.', 'It is the heavenly fount from which pours the light that shines across Hisui. Its luminance guides and protects all Pokémon. Hisuian mythology states that Arceus is the creator of all things.'),
  ('hisui', 238, 10041, false, '우주가 아직 생기지 않았을 무렵에 처음으로 태어난 포켓몬이라고 신화 속에서 묘사된다.', 'It is the heavenly fount from which pours the light that shines across Hisui. Its luminance guides and protects all Pokémon. Hisuian mythology states that Arceus is the creator of all things.'),
